n when Kelsey Harris got on the  stand right yeah Jesse Kelsey Harris was  supposed to be the prosecution star  witness and she was anything but her  testimony left people speculating when  she paid off she testified to Tory Lanez  offering her a million dollars for a  lawyer but then she pled the fifth when  asked if Tory Lanez threatened her but  how would that answer incriminate her  unless it bleeds into what she did in  response so the question becomes what  did Kelsey say or do in response to  being threatened by Tory Lanez add on  top of that she said that she told  investigators back in September  statements that were the Bedrock of the  prosecution's opening statements were  now false but at the end of the day in  this criminal case it only matters what  these 12 jurors think and so far I can't  imagine they're all on the same page and  if they are that spell and sorry if  they're not that spells reasonable doubt  that may lead to a hung jury or not  guilty I don't know if Tory Lanez is  innocent or not but that's not what the  jury is deciding is deciding if the  prosecution has proven their case Beyond  A Reasonable Doubt and that after Kelsey  Harris's testimony I'm not sure here's a  prediction I think at the end of this  we'll still not know exactly what  happened that day that's my prediction  Brian great explanation thank you so  much

